  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Mejoramiento de Barrios Habitar Brasil</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Neighborhood Improvement Inhabit Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM&apos;S OBJECTIVE IS: TO CONTRUBUTE TO THE GOVERNMENT EFFORT TO CONSOLIDATE AND IMPLEMENT THE NATIONAL HOUSING POLICY THROUGH INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING; AND TO IMPROVE QUALITY OF LIFE OF LOW INCOME POPULATION IN METROPOLITAN AREAS THROUGH INTEGRATED NIEGHBORHOOD PROYECTS, INCLUDING SANITATION, EDUCATION, HEALTH, TRASH DISPOSALS SYSTEMS AND THE ENVIROMENT.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
